{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13211100","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13211100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1321110001:1":{"text":"阿廖娜，你又来做祝祷啦？光凭虔诚地祈祷，可没办法成为侍奉女神的修女，你得改掉顶嘴的坏习惯才行。","source_cn":"阿廖娜，你又来做祝祷啦？光凭虔诚地祈祷，可没办法成为侍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BB4B0DE45727B85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321110002:1":{"text":"……我已经改正很多了！","source_cn":"……我已经改正很多了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D3FE8E122083763","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321110003:1":{"text":"倒是你，怎么在这里？没去找传说中的风景吗？","source_cn":"倒是你，怎么在这里？没去找传说中的风景吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AF58C66703061A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321110004:1":{"text":"啊！你怎么知道的？！你没有告诉阿尔希普吧？！","source_cn":"啊！你怎么知道的？！你没有告诉阿尔希普吧？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6E386BBA4F93FF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321110005:1":{"text":"当然没有。我哪会做这种事？","source_cn":"当然没有。我哪会做这种事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA339009A316681D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"